            "text": "{\n  \"replies\": [\n    {\n      \"author\": \"@William02216755\",\n      \"text\": \"That business owner would have lost my business FOR LIFE.\\nWhy would ANY business owner treat their customers like that?!\\nWhen you lose 1 customer, it could be 10. Word of mouth is the best, or worst, advertising one can get.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"author\": \"@smouse_lillee\",\n      \"text\": \"The customer.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"author\": \"@saralynne65\",\n      \"text\": \"@JoeyTomatoes staff behavior was abhorrent, just outright assholes ruining a birthday party .\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"author\": \"@JimmyBenningho2\",\n      \"text\": \"The owner just \u201ckilled\u201d her own restaurant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"author\": \"@kingofkings0247\",\n      \"text\": \"Most restaurants have a no outside food or drink policy but would allow for exceptions for something like a birthday cake with permission. They said they called ahead. That\u2019s just bad business.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"author\": \"@idontgethowthis\",\n      \"text\": \"The staff should have volunteered to cut and serve the cake after the celebration. Joey Tomatoes needs to pound sand.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
